			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740450401,
					"content": "欢迎光临，这里是全枫丹廷宝石种类最齐全的商铺，还有各类工艺品出售。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450402,
					"content": "有什么你们看得上眼的东西吗？没有的话要是有什么其它想要的也尽管问我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450403,
					"content": "我们手上有些神奇的矿石…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450404,
					"content": "嗯嗯，既然是宝石种类最齐全的商铺，那你一定也会清楚我们手上矿石的价值咯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450405,
					"content": "哦哦，原来你们是来兜售矿石的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450406,
					"content": "那你们可找对人了，我这里的收购价格，可以说是童叟无欺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450407,
					"content": "那么，是什么样的矿石呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450408,
					"content": "你将之前找到的奇异矿石拿出来交给了切瑟尔查看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450409,
					"content": "这…没想到竟然是连我也没见过的矿石…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450410,
					"content": "不过这奇异的色泽，这光滑的质地…肯定是非常珍稀的品类没错！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450411,
					"content": "虽然这样说不太好意思，不过恕我见识短浅，敢问这到底是什么矿石呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450412,
						740450414,
						740450416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450412,
					"content": "我也不清楚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450413
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450413,
					"content": "所以你们才来找我鉴定的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450419,
					"content": "不过这样的矿石竟然只有一块，实在可惜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450420,
					"content": "如果能有足够的货源，说不定就可以打磨制作出足以风靡整个枫丹的饰品了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450421,
					"content": "（我记得芙佳说过这样的石头在矿脉附近到处都是，要是问问她的话…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450422,
						740450424,
						740450427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450422,
					"content": "这样的矿石我们还有不少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450423
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450423,
					"content": "真的吗，那可真是太好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450430,
					"content": "既然这样的话，你们手上的矿石我愿意买下，并且我还想通过你们的渠道购入更多的矿石，来制作一批工艺品。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450431,
					"content": "当然为表诚意，货款我会提前预付给你们，只要下次来的时候你们能把更多的矿石带给我就行了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450432,
					"content": "怎么样，我觉得是笔公平的交易，不知你们意下如何？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450433,
					"content": "嘿嘿，我也觉得不错，那就成交啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450434,
					"content": "那真的是太好了，这是给你们的货款…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450435,
					"content": "这样的宝石能做出什么样的饰品呢，哈哈，我都已经开始期待了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450436,
					"content": "那么我就在此静候佳音了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450424,
					"content": "货源可是商业机密。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450425,
					"content": "哦哦，这是当然…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450426,
					"content": "不过，只要你们有进货的渠道那就太好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450427,
					"content": "其实在「厄里那斯」那里就有很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450428
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450428,
					"content": "喂，你怎么直接告诉他了啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450429,
					"content": "原来是从「厄里那斯」那里找到的吗？的确一般不会有人深入那里寻找矿脉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450414,
					"content": "可能是叫「派派石」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450415,
					"content": "什么啦，不要起奇怪的名字吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450416,
					"content": "当然是叫「闪耀的琉璃色金」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450417
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740450417,
					"content": "唔，是你刚编出来的名字吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740450418,
					"content": "竟然是叫这样厉害的名字，怪不得看上去会这么特殊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740450419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "切瑟尔"
				}
			]
